The files in this directory are a minimal subset of StratL
(Puech et al., "StratL: Pedagogical Steering of LLMs for Tutoring")
used only as a paper baseline.

We include IntentSelector, RigidPromptGenerator, taxonomy, and utils.
API-key loaders from the original repository are intentionally omitted;
the DICE StratL runner uses local Hugging Face / vLLM teachers.
